  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/3b714ebff8f91c7254c40607071d1cca.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"433\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong>繁體中文：</strong></span></p><hr><p>Flanny FNAF Mod 是一個靈感來自《<strong>FNAF</strong>》宇宙的模組，由 Flanny 社群開發與服務。<br>此模組中的機械動物玩偶（Animatronics）由社群成員在活動中創作，目標是設計並畫出屬於自己的機械玩偶。<br><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#008080;font-size:18px\"><strong>模組目標：</strong></span><br>- 發掘社群創作的機械玩偶。<br>- 在夜晚中存活，不殺死機械玩偶。<br>- 解謎收集機械玩偶布偶。<br>- 收集《FNAF 1》的面具。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#008080;font-size:18px\"><strong>模組新增內容：</strong></span><br>- 19 個從社群創作中選出的機械玩偶<br>- FNAF 模組及其他裝飾品<br>- 新的木材/植物/礦物<br>- 回收台及其他機制</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/584876e4baa1a86b4d1c036953bc85e3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"857\" height=\"498\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0j6H55F/Sans-titre-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1105\" height=\"689\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ndPN322a8BU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong>English :&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p><hr><pre>&nbsp;</pre><p>The Flanny FNAF Mod is a mod inspired by the FNAF universe, developed for and by the Flanny Community</p><p>The Animatronics available on this mod were imagined and drawn by members of the community during an event.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#008080;font-size:18px\"><strong>The purpose of the mod:</strong></span></p><p>- Discover the animatronics created by the community<br>- Survive animatronics at night without killing them<br>- Collect animatronic plushies by solving puzzles<br>- Collect masks from FNAF 1</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#008080;font-size:18px\"><strong>The mod adds:</strong></span><br>- 19 animatronics form community creation<br>- Decorations from Fnaf Mod and other<br>- New woods/plants/minerals<br>- A recycling table and other mechanics<br><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ndPN322a8BU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/ccbb71a8e57d74672c899ad5c5c2ba2c.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/113359a95c28a8d6e5a9d0d592360283.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"955\" height=\"550\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/8dd28c20b2bea6e96ef13a277ed04cb2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"954\" height=\"614\"><br><br><br></p>",
